[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4684.224, "timestamp": "01:18:04", "text": "他们推出了一个新角色。那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4685.181, "timestamp": "01:18:05", "text": "他们推出过这个角色吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4690.056, "timestamp": "01:18:10", "text": "我想，他们引入了两个新角色。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4694.349, "timestamp": "01:18:14", "text": "本赛季。他们是 Jubilee 和，呃，The"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4701.39, "timestamp": "01:18:21", "text": "兜帽。而朱比利就像一位战略家，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4704.121, "timestamp": "01:18:24", "text": "你知道，就是损害。而《街区》就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4707.113, "timestamp": "01:18:27", "text": "一辆坦克，上面装着格洛克手枪之类的东西，你知道的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4714.089, "timestamp": "01:18:34", "text": "两把手枪。我们会玩什么游戏？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4716.741, "timestamp": "01:18:36", "text": "我们的角色会是什么？伙计们，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4721.609, "timestamp": "01:18:41", "text": "他们将扮演治疗者的角色。是的，他们已经知道了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4724.075, "timestamp": "01:18:44", "text": "谁来扮演治疗师，谁会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4730.273, "timestamp": "01:18:50", "text": "坦克和输出位。哦是的。有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4732.192, "timestamp": "01:18:52", "text": "一些类似的新角色"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4732.291, "timestamp": "01:18:52", "text": "到"}]